  "title": "Vibrant Spicy Malaysian Chicken Curry",
  "description": "A spicy and flavorful Malaysian dish featuring chicken cooked in a rich and creamy curry sauce, perfect for satisfying midnight cravings. This recipe incorporates palm sugar and nam tan pip for added depth of flavor.",
